From a2b4aa8096330fabbf41b1dd40be2562da7a3a9d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: buzz-host <buzz-host@localhost>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 03:00:32 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] buzz-host: treat Buzz Solo chats as one top-level
 conversation

Channels labelled buzz.solo (NIP-CL) are conversation-scoped under every
session policy, and top-level mentions there are answered at the top level,
matching Buzz's own agent harness. Mentions are still required.
